WEBVTT

00:18.810 --> 00:22.510
<i>Gokusen</i>

00:22.780 --> 00:28.020
<i>How long has it been</i>
<i>since that day when we first met?</i>

00:28.190 --> 00:33.720
<i>So many good times and bad times</i>
<i>have come and gone since then.</i>

00:33.900 --> 00:39.060
<i>I know you can't make sense</i>
<i>of what I'm trying to say.</i>

00:39.230 --> 00:44.500
<i>But my true feelings for you</i>
<i>can never be put into words.</i>

00:44.810 --> 00:50.250
<i>Will you ever know how I feel?</i>
<i>Will you know what's going on inside me?</i>

00:50.450 --> 00:55.880
<i>If only we could live in a world where</i>
<i>you only have to be yourself and smile.</i>

00:56.050 --> 01:01.320
<i>Or is it always going to be like this?</i>
<i>Will we be able to go on like this?</i>

01:01.520 --> 01:09.230
<i>Even if you're far away, I want to</i>
<i>feel you in my heart, close to me.</i>

01:31.550 --> 01:33.020
<i>Shirokin High School</i>

01:43.930 --> 01:45.830
Un-frickin' believable...

01:47.740 --> 01:49.670
This gives my morale...

01:52.640 --> 01:54.540
...a real boost!

01:56.210 --> 02:01.170
<i>ROOKIE TEACHER WITH A SECRETIS BORN!</i>

02:04.820 --> 02:07.190
Well, well! What a treat!

02:07.590 --> 02:11.050
What a sight for sore eyes
you women teachers are!

02:12.390 --> 02:14.230
Really, you're prodigious!

02:21.670 --> 02:25.070
So, I understand you've
hired these two to teach?

02:25.170 --> 02:26.400
Is that correct?

02:26.640 --> 02:27.370
Correct.

02:27.480 --> 02:31.910
Ms. Fujiyama will teach music,
and Ms. Yamaguchi will teach math.

02:32.810 --> 02:36.050
What in the world are you thinking?
Female teachers at this school?

02:36.350 --> 02:39.550
That's like throwing pigs
into the lion's den!

02:39.650 --> 02:41.090
Pigs...

02:39.920 --> 02:43.520
Really, you have no idea what goes on here!

02:50.100 --> 02:52.760
Yo, yo,
I hear the new teacher's the bomb!

02:53.430 --> 02:54.200
Whaddya mean?

02:54.570 --> 02:57.130
What did they do, bring over
Hulk Hogan or something?

02:57.340 --> 02:58.600
Wrong!

02:58.870 --> 03:00.930
This one's got these...

03:01.040 --> 03:02.670
...and these!

03:03.380 --> 03:04.940
Jesus! It's a woman?

03:07.280 --> 03:08.910
We owe you one, Baldie!

03:09.020 --> 03:10.650
Gotta make sure
she feels welcome, right?

03:12.350 --> 03:15.150
Now, now, our students
are still just youngsters!

03:15.620 --> 03:19.080
I'm sure deep down inside,
they're crying out for love.

03:19.190 --> 03:22.160
Now, with a woman teacher's
all-enveloping love...

03:22.330 --> 03:24.490
You're naive! Naive! Naive!

03:24.600 --> 03:28.040
That's exactly what
gives them their swagger!

03:31.110 --> 03:33.270
Let this be your warning, ladies...

03:33.610 --> 03:37.010
If you should underestimate our students,
you will not live to tell the tale!

03:37.210 --> 03:38.370
Ms. Fujiyama!

03:38.480 --> 03:39.170
Yes?

03:39.350 --> 03:41.650
You're dressed too provocatively!

03:41.750 --> 03:45.050
The students will treat you
no better than a stripper!

03:46.290 --> 03:47.810
As for you, Ms. Yamaguchi...

03:47.920 --> 03:48.550
Y-Yes?

03:48.660 --> 03:52.680
Those slippers! Just try fleeing from
the students at top speed with those on!

03:53.130 --> 03:53.860
Flee?

03:54.000 --> 03:57.230
If you want to survive, you must
wear track suits and sneakers.

03:57.600 --> 03:59.120
That's de rigueur!

04:02.070 --> 04:04.100
And always move in
groups of two or more!

04:04.210 --> 04:06.730
Better yet,
a squadron of seven or eight!

04:07.180 --> 04:08.840
All right, then.
I wish you all godspeed!

04:13.080 --> 04:14.450
Whoa...

04:15.320 --> 04:18.450
Okay, Ms. Yamaguchi,
let's try to stay alive!

04:18.920 --> 04:19.890
Okay!

04:20.560 --> 04:24.250
That's right, I'm a teacher now. I guess
I should go in there with guns blazing.

04:25.090 --> 04:25.920
Okay!

04:36.840 --> 04:38.640
Who the hell are you?

04:39.040 --> 04:41.340
Whaddya mean?
I'm your homeroom teacher.

04:42.310 --> 04:43.210
Huh?

04:43.310 --> 04:47.010
Hell Minami, I thought you said
she had boobs and an ass!

04:47.380 --> 04:49.080
And a mini-skirt, remember?

04:49.180 --> 04:50.520
What the hell?

04:51.550 --> 04:54.490
Oh, you're talking about
Ms. Fujiyama from Class 2.

04:54.590 --> 04:57.020
But guess what, she changed
into a track suit, too.

04:57.190 --> 04:58.680
What are you talking about?

04:58.830 --> 05:00.090
Don't jerk us around, bitch!

05:05.570 --> 05:08.260
<i>Shirokin Striptease</i>

05:08.600 --> 05:12.230
Well, look at that! So the vice-principal
did have them all figured out!

05:15.710 --> 05:18.080
Oh man, this one's a total dweeb, I bet!

05:18.180 --> 05:20.170
Bet she keeps track of
her spending money, too.

05:20.820 --> 05:23.680
How come we're stuck with <i>her</i>
for our homeroom teacher?

05:25.650 --> 05:26.710
Anyway...

05:32.430 --> 05:34.230
Oh, my gosh! You scared me!

05:35.300 --> 05:36.630
What a dork!

05:37.030 --> 05:39.470
For chrissake!
Is she a total moron or what?

05:40.100 --> 05:41.590
Can't you tell by looking at her?

05:41.840 --> 05:43.740
Kuma, you need to chill.

05:46.640 --> 05:47.340
Huh?

05:47.410 --> 05:48.240
Shin!

05:50.480 --> 05:53.570
You never show up this early in the day!

05:54.220 --> 05:57.210
Hmmm, that's not your
normal pecking order...

06:01.390 --> 06:02.720
Looks like she's our homeroom teacher.

06:03.020 --> 06:04.080
Homeroom teacher?

06:04.690 --> 06:05.790
That's right!

06:05.890 --> 06:07.590
All right then, now that we're all here...

06:07.700 --> 06:12.290
Let me introduce myself! I'm your
homeroom teacher, Kumiko Yamaguchi!

06:15.770 --> 06:16.790
Nobody's listening...

06:17.000 --> 06:20.460
I hear Class 2's teacher's
totally stacked.

06:20.580 --> 06:24.310
But we're getting stuck
with this four-eyed ape?

06:26.080 --> 06:29.180
I want to get to know you all
as soon as possible, so...

06:29.320 --> 06:32.250
...please write down your name on this sheet,
plus anything else you'd like to share.

06:35.460 --> 06:38.720
Such as something you're really into
right now, or your dreams for the future...

06:38.890 --> 06:41.560
Oh, and you can also talk
about your girlfriends!

06:42.130 --> 06:43.620
For chrissake...

06:44.100 --> 06:45.530
Are you shitting us or what?

06:45.600 --> 06:47.130
What have you been smoking, bitch?

06:48.640 --> 06:49.730
Calm down, now.

06:49.840 --> 06:52.930
If you really don't want to write anything,
you can just put down your name.

06:53.310 --> 06:55.300
I'm going to write about
myself on blackboard, okay?

06:55.580 --> 06:56.600
Let's see...

06:56.710 --> 06:59.700
Kumiko Yamaguchi. 23 years old. Single!

06:59.810 --> 07:01.010
My hobbies are...

07:08.960 --> 07:10.220
Get her on the ass.

07:11.790 --> 07:12.820
Nice shot!

07:19.430 --> 07:21.030
Hey man, you're not hurling that...

07:32.480 --> 07:34.110
Hey! What is this?

07:34.350 --> 07:35.940
Isn't this a pachinko ball?

07:36.120 --> 07:38.810
That's dangerous! Who threw this?

07:40.020 --> 07:41.580
She really is a dork.

07:42.090 --> 07:43.850
So now she's scared?

07:43.990 --> 07:45.980
She's just lucky she snagged it.

07:46.090 --> 07:48.030
For a second there she
had me floored, though.

07:48.330 --> 07:51.530
But the timing was perfect,
don'tcha think so, Shin?

07:59.140 --> 08:01.010
Well, we survived our first day...

08:03.010 --> 08:05.500
You seem like a total straight-arrow,
Ms. Yamaguchi...

08:05.680 --> 08:07.080
Tell me, how bad was it?

08:07.220 --> 08:08.680
Oh, well, I think it went okay.

08:08.950 --> 08:10.540
How was Class 2?

08:10.920 --> 08:12.820
Hmm, three of them...

08:13.220 --> 08:14.710
No, wait, make that two.

08:14.990 --> 08:16.180
Two what?

08:17.020 --> 08:18.460
Students I wouldn't mind sleeping with!

08:19.390 --> 08:21.660
Well, you know, I've been teaching
junior high kids till now.

08:22.000 --> 08:25.630
High school boys are a lot <i>bigger,</i> see...

08:26.430 --> 08:29.340
Oh, hey! That didn't come out right!

08:35.010 --> 08:37.270
Ms. Yamaguchi, Ms. Fujiyama!

08:37.380 --> 08:41.110
You mustn't engage in idle chatter after
classes. I order you to withdraw at once!

08:41.480 --> 08:42.970
Withdraw?

08:43.080 --> 08:45.610
This is the most dangerous
time of day, ladies!

08:51.230 --> 08:52.090
Fuji!

08:56.300 --> 08:59.060
Hey, boy, did you come
to pick me up from school?

08:59.330 --> 09:01.930
Hey, is this your dog?

09:02.070 --> 09:02.540
Yes.

09:02.840 --> 09:06.830
Wow, you must live in a huge house
to be able to keep a dog like this.

09:06.970 --> 09:08.170
Well...

09:09.640 --> 09:11.440
Ms. Fujiyama!

09:11.650 --> 09:12.880
Your ass is so sexy!

09:12.980 --> 09:14.040
It's the bomb!

09:14.280 --> 09:16.110
Oh, jeez...

09:26.560 --> 09:27.860
That woman...

09:28.500 --> 09:29.490
That new homeroom teacher...

09:31.100 --> 09:32.460
Kumiko Yamaguchi?

09:32.570 --> 09:33.630
What about her?

09:34.500 --> 09:36.730
She's not half as dumb
as she makes out to be.

09:38.170 --> 09:40.700
Whaddya mean, as she makes out to be?

09:41.340 --> 09:43.610
I'm not sure, but that's
what my gut tells me.

09:43.980 --> 09:46.540
She's probably twice as dumb
as she looks, that's all!

09:46.810 --> 09:48.910
Didn't you see how scared
shitless Kuma made her?

09:49.020 --> 09:50.180
You got it!

09:50.990 --> 09:52.580
<i>Fuji, come on, we're going home.</i>

09:53.220 --> 09:54.880
Scared, huh?

09:55.020 --> 09:56.990
You're living in a dream world, kids.

09:57.090 --> 09:59.650
You have no idea...

10:00.230 --> 10:03.960
<i>Ooedo Clan</i>

10:15.080 --> 10:17.140
Ojou!

10:17.480 --> 10:18.470
I'm home.

10:18.950 --> 10:21.440
Ojou, welcome home.

10:23.750 --> 10:26.880
Now then, you must tell your parents
about your first day of work.

10:27.760 --> 10:28.480
Okay!

10:33.730 --> 10:35.460
Father, Mother...

10:36.060 --> 10:40.160
I became a teacher today,
just like I've always wanted.

10:41.270 --> 10:42.830
Please, watch over me.

10:48.340 --> 10:53.750
So, Ojou, how was your first day
operating as a teacher?

10:53.910 --> 10:57.780
Not one of them called me "teacher,"
it was "bitch" this "bitch" that...

10:58.090 --> 10:59.280
What?

11:00.450 --> 11:02.980
"Are you a moron, bitch?"
You know, like that.

11:03.160 --> 11:04.220
What the hell?

11:04.330 --> 11:08.290
How dare they speak
to our Ojou like that!

11:09.230 --> 11:11.790
Ojou, think I should pay them a visit?

11:12.430 --> 11:14.460
Just say the word and I'll go...

11:15.500 --> 11:16.230
Tetsu...

11:16.340 --> 11:17.360
Fuhgeddaboutit!

11:17.640 --> 11:19.970
We're talking about
ordinary piss-ant schoolboys...

11:20.070 --> 11:21.510
Exactly! So there's
no need for you to...

11:21.610 --> 11:24.310
Goddammit, I'm going!

11:26.610 --> 11:30.240
If anything should happen to our Ojou,
how could I live with myself?

11:30.350 --> 11:32.410
Wakamatsu, you're in charge
if I don't return!

11:32.850 --> 11:35.020
Number Two, I'm going with you!

11:35.420 --> 11:38.790
You moron! I'm supposed to die
first, that's the way it works!

11:38.930 --> 11:43.330
If you guys go down with me,
who's going to protect Ojou?

11:43.460 --> 11:45.490
Number Two!

11:45.870 --> 11:46.530
Idiots!

11:46.630 --> 11:50.260
If you guys go out there
you'll blow my cover.

11:50.640 --> 11:52.440
Are you trying to get my ass fired?

11:53.340 --> 11:57.440
Then I'll have no choice but to go down
there as one who's washed his feet...

11:57.550 --> 11:59.040
Enough.

12:00.050 --> 12:01.020
Kumicho!

12:01.150 --> 12:04.950
You are not to act rashly
for Kumiko's sake.

12:05.950 --> 12:07.080
Yes, Boss!

12:07.250 --> 12:09.450
Grandfather, you should be in bed.

12:10.290 --> 12:11.950
Kumiko, forgive me.

12:12.060 --> 12:14.820
If only I hadn't gotten sick
I wouldn't have had to lay this on you.

12:14.930 --> 12:18.960
...just when you're starting
your teaching career...

12:19.730 --> 12:21.070
What are you talking about?

12:21.440 --> 12:25.930
I know it's quite a burden for
a woman to be Acting Kumicho...

12:27.510 --> 12:28.600
Don't worry about it.

12:31.710 --> 12:34.440
Remember, I grew up here.

12:34.750 --> 12:37.740
My mother hated the Gokudo world...

12:37.890 --> 12:39.720
...but I can live in it.

12:42.690 --> 12:45.130
High school teacher <i>and</i>
bearer of the Ooedo crest...

12:45.230 --> 12:47.490
I assure you I'm up to both jobs!

12:47.600 --> 12:49.500
Ojou!

12:51.500 --> 12:54.530
Capiche? This is Ojou's home...

12:54.870 --> 12:58.270
These thugs are her family.

13:00.370 --> 13:04.570
She's not gonna be scared
by some high school punks!

13:09.280 --> 13:13.410
Just leave all the finer details of
the operation to the Underboss and me.

13:13.650 --> 13:15.490
Keep up the good work as a teacher...

13:15.860 --> 13:17.950
...since it's what
you've always dreamed of.

13:20.830 --> 13:22.800
Shinohara-sensei!

13:23.200 --> 13:23.890
Good night.

13:25.030 --> 13:26.430
Good night, Consigliere!

13:26.530 --> 13:28.230
Shinohara-sensei...

13:28.400 --> 13:29.870
Come here, Kumiko...

13:34.280 --> 13:36.210
Shinohara-sensei!

13:38.610 --> 13:41.210
"Keep up the good work
as a teacher...", he said!

13:41.720 --> 13:42.940
I'm gonna give it all I've got!

13:54.960 --> 13:55.900
Got that?

13:56.000 --> 13:57.460
Meet us behind the gym!

13:57.870 --> 13:59.770
And you better friggin' show up alone!

14:02.670 --> 14:04.640
Kumai? What are you doing?

14:04.740 --> 14:05.930
Class is about to start.

14:07.540 --> 14:09.700
Hey! What's going on?

14:10.380 --> 14:12.570
Shut up! It's none of
your damn business!

14:22.390 --> 14:24.360
Okay! Take your seats, class!

14:25.890 --> 14:27.860
<i>Yankumi's hair and all!</i>
<i>First Pubic Appearance</i>

14:28.260 --> 14:31.720
Little morons, they can't even spell!

14:35.740 --> 14:37.830
Wanna bet on whether
she loses it or cries?

14:38.910 --> 14:40.600
You're on! Ten bucks says
she busts out crying.

14:40.710 --> 14:41.970
OK, then I say she goes apeshit.

14:43.080 --> 14:44.840
Holy crap...

14:44.950 --> 14:46.350
The nipples are humongous!

14:50.220 --> 14:53.480
Hey, guys! What's this "Yankumi?"
That's not ME, is it?

14:54.090 --> 14:57.350
Whaddya think? Yamaguchi Kumiko,
so that makes you Yankumi.

14:57.490 --> 14:59.720
My idea! I'm the one
who came up with it!

15:00.090 --> 15:02.260
So it really is my nickname?

15:02.360 --> 15:03.800
It's kinda cute!

15:04.030 --> 15:05.290
Are you kidding?

15:05.630 --> 15:06.930
What a moron!

15:07.270 --> 15:08.700
Damn, that's lame!
And we made her happy!

15:08.800 --> 15:10.670
So the bet's off, huh?

15:10.770 --> 15:11.830
What a clueless woman!
Right, Kuma?

15:11.940 --> 15:14.840
Yo Kuma, what's going on?

15:16.040 --> 15:17.980
Yankumi, huh?

15:19.050 --> 15:20.340
Well, compared to all
my other nicknames...

15:20.780 --> 15:22.910
Come on, you goons!
Get ready to move out!

15:24.620 --> 15:26.590
No!

15:29.920 --> 15:31.790
Please, stop! Kumicho!

15:33.230 --> 15:35.320
Kumicho, don't do this!

15:35.500 --> 15:37.360
Well, maybe that was a little...

15:38.170 --> 15:39.630
<i>Teacher's Lounge</i>

15:39.770 --> 15:42.130
Hey, this is great!
It really takes the cake...

15:42.240 --> 15:43.430
Doesn't it, though?

15:44.000 --> 15:46.270
Check out these nipples!

15:48.010 --> 15:51.970
M-Ms. Yamaguchi, I had no idea
you were so well-endowed...

15:52.210 --> 15:55.670
Principal, it's fake, it's fake!

15:56.580 --> 15:59.080
Hey man, can't you
tell by looking at me?

15:59.220 --> 16:00.620
Ms. Yamaguchi!

16:01.120 --> 16:04.350
Don't get too carried away, or
they'll make you pay for it later!

16:04.460 --> 16:05.550
Yes, sir.

16:06.290 --> 16:06.890
Huh!

16:07.460 --> 16:10.900
Oh, Sekiguchi, are you all right?

16:12.430 --> 16:14.830
Did you have the nurse look at you?

16:16.800 --> 16:18.300
What's going on?

16:19.310 --> 16:21.570
I think somebody beat him up!

16:22.240 --> 16:23.270
Sekiguchi?

16:23.510 --> 16:25.450
But he runs Class 2!

16:26.410 --> 16:30.150
I know, but he refuses to talk about it.

16:30.850 --> 16:34.880
Of course not, real men
don't rat each other out...

16:35.060 --> 16:35.990
Rat...?

16:36.320 --> 16:39.620
Anyway, it's our job to get to
the bottom of these things, right?

16:42.130 --> 16:44.390
It might be one of
the seniors, you know.

16:44.800 --> 16:45.860
A senior?

16:45.970 --> 16:49.130
There's this kid named Kudoh
who got expelled last year.

16:49.240 --> 16:50.470
Really bad news!

16:50.600 --> 16:54.410
I heard he's been sneaking onto school
grounds lately, running a posse of seniors...

16:55.640 --> 16:58.410
Little punk's hitting
the mattresses, huh?

16:58.780 --> 16:59.580
Huh?

16:59.880 --> 17:01.140
Never mind!

17:01.720 --> 17:05.380
Well, so long as they're just rubbing
each other out, we'll allow it...

17:06.090 --> 17:10.110
...but if things should get out of hand,
you must report it immediately!

17:11.230 --> 17:14.390
What the hell? Is that any way to
talk about our precious students?

17:15.500 --> 17:17.020
<i>Meet us behind the gym!</i>

17:17.130 --> 17:18.930
<i>And you better friggin' show up alone!</i>

17:19.770 --> 17:21.500
Hey, what's wrong?

17:30.280 --> 17:32.680
You've got too much
attitude for a junior, man!

17:32.810 --> 17:34.080
Come on, get up!

17:37.350 --> 17:38.720
Kudoh...

17:40.520 --> 17:44.190
They kicked you out,
so why'd you come back?

17:46.960 --> 17:50.830
As soon as I left, you juniors started
walking all over my guys.

17:50.930 --> 17:52.700
I wasn't gonna let you get away with that.

17:52.970 --> 17:55.800
Anyway, I'm doing this for my rep.

17:56.040 --> 17:59.300
If I can't even control my own school, it's
not gonna look good on my resume, is it?

18:00.440 --> 18:01.640
Wouldn't you agree?

18:02.780 --> 18:04.640
Hey, wait a sec! Someone's coming!

18:07.510 --> 18:09.140
Oh, it's just that rookie teacher.

18:09.380 --> 18:10.870
She's their homeroom teacher, you know.

18:11.720 --> 18:14.050
Oh yeah? I think I smell a rat...

18:14.250 --> 18:14.850
No!

18:14.960 --> 18:17.080
Kudoh, I think he's in the clear.

18:18.090 --> 18:20.290
Looks like she just came to
put away some volleyballs.

18:23.400 --> 18:24.490
Whoops!

18:24.600 --> 18:25.930
Come back here, you!

18:27.470 --> 18:28.630
Jeez!

18:29.300 --> 18:31.240
What are you boys doing here?

18:32.040 --> 18:34.030
Kumai! What's going on?

18:34.840 --> 18:36.040
You moron, look behind you!

18:36.510 --> 18:39.040
Yo Teach, good timing!

18:39.150 --> 18:41.050
Hey, what do you think you're doing?

18:41.520 --> 18:43.640
Woo hoo! Let's get this
party started, guys!

18:43.820 --> 18:45.790
Let Yankumi go!

18:46.390 --> 18:47.980
Oh no! Kumai!

18:48.260 --> 18:50.450
Yankumi... you idiot...

18:52.730 --> 18:53.750
Kumai!

18:58.700 --> 18:59.260
They've got Kuma?

18:59.370 --> 19:01.770
You heard me! He got called out
by a bunch of seniors!

19:04.770 --> 19:05.400
Where's he?

19:05.510 --> 19:07.570
Damned if I know.
He said he'd be okay on his own...

19:07.670 --> 19:09.640
You know Kudoh's gotta be behind this!

19:11.480 --> 19:13.970
We're so screwed, Shin!
What should we do?

19:14.250 --> 19:16.510
I'll be right there.
You guys go look for Kuma!

19:17.020 --> 19:17.780
Gotcha!

19:18.220 --> 19:20.310
Listen, there's no telling
what Kudoh might do...

19:20.420 --> 19:22.120
...so maybe we should talk to Yankumi?

19:22.220 --> 19:24.450
Come on, what good would that do?

19:26.160 --> 19:26.860
Kumai?

19:27.390 --> 19:28.230
Kumai?

19:29.230 --> 19:30.290
Are you unconscious?

19:30.400 --> 19:31.630
Hey, Kumai!

19:32.170 --> 19:33.260
What the hell are you doing?

19:33.900 --> 19:37.500
Now then, why don't I have a little
fun with you, instead of Kumai?

19:38.370 --> 19:39.500
Yankumi...

19:39.940 --> 19:41.410
Wait, he's not unconscious.

19:47.810 --> 19:48.340
Good.

19:48.780 --> 19:51.080
Good? What's the big idea, bitch?

19:54.660 --> 19:56.590
Which one of you little shits is Kudoh?

19:59.030 --> 20:00.190
So it's you, huh?

20:02.130 --> 20:04.860
I don't like these kinds of games, see?

20:05.930 --> 20:07.700
Who the hell are you, bitch?

20:08.140 --> 20:08.970
Me?

20:10.370 --> 20:12.840
I'm nothing but a homeroom teacher...

20:14.410 --> 20:15.600
Oh yeah?

20:31.590 --> 20:36.620
If you mess with my students,
I'll have your...

20:36.760 --> 20:37.820
...ASS!

20:41.200 --> 20:41.900
Kuma!

20:43.200 --> 20:44.600
Are you okay, Kuma?

20:48.110 --> 20:49.580
Hey, Kuma, snap out of it!

20:50.640 --> 20:51.700
Shin?

20:52.980 --> 20:55.180
What did they do to Yankumi?

20:55.320 --> 20:56.180
Yankumi?

20:56.280 --> 20:57.340
You know, Yamaguchi.

20:57.480 --> 20:58.920
Was Yamaguchi here?

20:59.350 --> 21:01.620
She was just passing by...

21:02.160 --> 21:04.420
...and then Kudoh got her.
By now, she must be...

21:05.490 --> 21:06.930
What the hell...

21:07.430 --> 21:09.190
Shin, check this out!

21:10.800 --> 21:12.230
It's that bastard Kudoh!

21:13.200 --> 21:14.730
Huh? I don't get it!

21:14.840 --> 21:16.030
Who the hell did this?

21:16.470 --> 21:17.530
Yamaguchi.

21:17.640 --> 21:18.660
Yankumi?

21:19.110 --> 21:20.840
No friggin' way, man!

21:22.040 --> 21:23.410
Hey, it's Yankumi's dog.

21:23.780 --> 21:27.210
I see, the dog jumped
in to save his owner.

21:27.410 --> 21:28.880
Yeah, that makes sense...

21:29.050 --> 21:30.950
She lucked out again, huh?

21:33.020 --> 21:36.620
No dog would pile human
bodies except in a cartoon.

21:40.190 --> 21:43.650
Come on, kiddo, don't try
to read too much into it.

21:43.760 --> 21:46.730
This one's my collar,
can't we just leave it at that?

21:47.130 --> 21:48.730
What the hell?

21:48.940 --> 21:49.870
Who knows?

21:52.810 --> 21:54.800
We're good, see.

22:07.520 --> 22:17.520
<i>We are all born</i>
<i>crying out to the world.</i>

22:18.600 --> 22:28.500
<i>Because of all the endless grief</i>
<i>that we must go through in life.</i>

22:29.310 --> 22:39.240
<i>All of the heartache</i>
<i>is such a heavy load to bear.</i>

22:39.420 --> 22:49.420
<i>On those days when I am alone and cold</i>
<i>I'll light a fire with my own two hands.</i>

22:49.960 --> 22:59.960
<i>Treacherous mountains are my chosen path.</i>
<i>I'll move forward without a backward glance.</i>

23:17.160 --> 23:20.090
What could make me happier?

23:20.190 --> 23:24.960
Now that our Ojou is on her way to
becoming the No. 1 teacher in Japan...

23:25.100 --> 23:26.460
...no, in the whole world!

23:26.600 --> 23:28.030
I guess it's time for me to...

23:28.140 --> 23:29.600
Huh? What's that?

23:29.940 --> 23:31.500
Ojou's been challenged to a duel?

23:31.640 --> 23:33.900
Says who and what
the hell is he thinking?

23:34.070 --> 23:37.640
He better watch his back, or else
he'll have to answer to Fuji!

23:38.150 --> 23:41.780
Next episode: Duel!! Shin vs. Ojou!

23:41.920 --> 23:44.320
What? So it's you, huh?
